      {
        "finding": "NSO reduces unscaled Hessian trace and often improves held-out performance, but Table 3's Caltech-256 result has lower trace and lower accuracy than SGD: 2958 versus 3674, and 78.1% versus 80.0%.",
        "proposed_claim": "Reducing unscaled Hessian trace through a training intervention does not uniformly improve test accuracy.",
