    "problems": "The generalization-gap comparisons in Figure 3 are curves without numerical values in the text. The experiments focus on fine-tuning pretrained ResNets and do not address the listed version-specific claims. Table 2 reports five-run results but uses datasets and methods outside the versions.",
    "rows_left_out": "Other distributions in Table 2 (Laplace, Uniform, Binomial) and results in Tables 3–6 and Figures 4–6 were left out because they compare NSO and related methods, sharpness measures, or other tasks without testing a listed version; Table 2's Gaussian rows preserve the natural-label train/test comparisons for all three datasets.",
